    energy="Energy superpower: Nuclear power (38 operating commercial reactors producing ~20% of electricity, global pioneer in fast-neutron reactors BN-800 and floating nuclear plants like Akademik Lomonosov), massive Hydroelectric cascades on the Volga, Yenisey, and Angara rivers (Sayano-Shushenskaya 6,400 MW), thermal natural gas generation, expanding wind and solar installations.",
